  "mach:judgementReason": "The leading open-source framework for clinical trial matching — government-backed (NCBI/NIH), published in Nature Communications (2024), v1.0.0 released. Demonstrates 42.6% reduction in screening time and near-expert criterion-level accuracy. Public domain (US Government work). High clinical research value for any team working on trial recruitment or eligibility screening.",
